WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Welcome to the Overview of Exceptional Customer Service Fundamentals.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
An important part of selling in the Amazon store is providing exceptional customer service.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.400
It is worth the investment because it results in positive seller ratings, word-of-mouth referrals,

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.000
and ultimately more sales.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:23.737
We train Amazon Customer Service Associates to keep the following guidelines in mind on every single

00:00:23.737 --> 00:00:25.000
contact with customers.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:31.000
As sellers, you can follow the same to provide a positive customer service experience to your customers.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:34.182
One, treat every customer as your friend.

00:00:34.182 --> 00:00:36.000
Be friendly and polite.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.500
Be your best professional self.

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:42.000
Show respect by being fair and honest.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.125
Be upbeat, empathetic, and patient.

00:00:45.125 --> 00:00:47.000
Deliver on promises.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Keep current on changes and aware of new information.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Approach the situation recognizing that each customer's need is unique.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:57.500
Two, know your customer.

00:00:57.500 --> 00:01:02.000
Listen to their problem and think through how it may impact them.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:07.000
With email, use simple and direct language that is easy to understand.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:08.636
Three, never guess.

00:01:08.636 --> 00:01:13.000
Carefully evaluate each customer question and answer it.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:18.000
Be precise and say with confidence only what you know is true and relevant.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:19.412
Do not speculate.

00:01:19.412 --> 00:01:26.000
When the answer is not available, say so in order to preserve customer trust.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:27.647
Four, solve the problem.

00:01:27.647 --> 00:01:33.000
Partner with customers to find the right solution that fits their unique needs.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:37.000
Seek out and use available resources to make things right.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:41.000
In the end, solving the problem is what matters most.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:47.818
Three things you can do to improve your customer service are sending quality communications using

00:01:47.818 --> 00:01:51.000
empathy and being efficient in your messages.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:02:01.833
Remember, quality communication is conversational, efficient, helpful, personal, direct, friendly,

00:02:01.833 --> 00:02:04.000
positive, simple.

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:11.000
Practicing these principles will help you deliver professional customer service every time.

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:17.000
The Oxford Dictionary defines empathy as the ability to understand and share the feelings of another.

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:22.844
In the context of customer service, this means striving to care for your customers in a considerate

00:02:22.844 --> 00:02:28.000
manner where you put yourself in their shoes and then reinforce the feeling with action.

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:33.000
To practice empathy with your customers, consider the five A's of empathy.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:39.000
Acknowledge, appreciate, assure, action, apologize.

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:43.000
Empathy fuels connection and allows you to partner with your customer.

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:48.000
Using empathy helps to build your customer's trust in your product or service.

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:53.000
Another way to improve customer service is to look for ways to make it more efficient.

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:57.000
You could establish a checklist to work through for every customer contact.

00:02:57.000 --> 00:03:03.000
That way, your responses are thorough, considerate, consistent, and prompt.

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:09.136
Finally, when answering customer contacts, take care to avoid speculation about the cause or resolution

00:03:09.136 --> 00:03:12.000
to any issue the customer is experiencing.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:17.000
Use your tools and resources to research and answer the question asked.

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:24.000
Answering customer questions with information you know to be true further builds customer trust.

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:29.000
This wraps up our video with tips on how to provide exceptional customer service.

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:32.000
Thank you and happy selling in the Amazon store.
